  skos:definition "The current version of the Azure Machine Learning Python SDK, provided by the azure-ai-ml package. It works with the same assets and jobs as CLI v2."@en ;
  skos:scopeNote "Use for current Python guidance. Prefer this concept over the general Python SDK concept when an article shows code."@en .

